{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>You will seek them.</b> מצותך — defective in nun, therefore the tsadi has a dagesh, on the pattern of מלקות, and likewise אוהב מצה (Proverbs 17:19) כי ינצו אנשים (Deuteronomy 25:11)." "<b>And as nothing.</b> Like 'not.'"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:20.663013356Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}